的两种组成。现进行下列实验,(1)取少量白色粉末,加水溶解,得到无色透明溶液。(2)向硫酸铝溶液逐滴加入上述溶液,无明显现象发生,根据以上实验现象,白色粉末的组成可能是____、____", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 1944133, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 21}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】CO<sub>2</sub>;6<br>【考情点拨】本题考查了氧化还原反应的知识点。<br>【应试指导】反应前后C的化合价升高,所以氧化产物为CO<sub>2</sub>,标准状况下,44.8L NO<sub>2</sub>即为44.8/22.4=2mol,该反应的还原剂为C,由化学反应方程式可知参与反应的C为2/4=0.5mol,C为该反应的还原剂,参与反应质量即为:0.5×12=6g", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 1944134, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2020年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 6, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 6, "source": "2020", "starCount": 0, "title": "反应C+4HNO<sub>3</sub> (浓)<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2021/H22.png' />CO<sub>2</sub>↑+4NO<sub>2</sub>↑+2H<sub>2</sub>O的氧化产物为____;若生成44.8L NO<sub>2</sub>气体(标准状况),参加反应的还原剂的质量是____g。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 1944134, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 22}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】11<br>【考情点拨】本题考查了化学反应pH值的计算的知识点。<br>【应试指导】pH=12即NaOH的浓度为10<sup>-14+12</sup>=0.01mol/L,100ml稀释至1L即稀释10倍,浓度变为0.001mol/L,pH=12-1=11(14+lg0.001=11) ", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 1944135, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2020年成考