br>将数值代入式中,可以解得E=6V,r=0.5Ω\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 1944139, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2020年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 11, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 11, "source": "2020", "starCount": 0, "title": "(11分)如图,将开关S接a点时,通过电阻R<sub>1</sub>的电流I<sub>1</sub>=2A。电源输出功率W<sub>1</sub>=10W;当开关S接b点时,通过电阻R<sub>2</sub>的电流I<sub>2</sub>=1A,电源输出功率W<sub>2</sub>=5.5W。求电源的电动势E和内阻r。<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2021/H23.png' />", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 1944139, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 27}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "(1)设物块C滑上B板后,A板的速度为v<sub>1</sub>\n<br>由动量守恒,mv<sub>0</sub>=2mv+mv<sub>1</sub>\n<br>解得v<sub>1</sub>=1m/s,则A板的动能<img src=http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2021/H41.png />\n<br>(2)整个系统的重力势能没发生改变,只需要考虑动能\n<br>系统刚开始的动能(即C板的动能): <img src=http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2021/H42.png />\n<br>系统稳定时候的动能: <img src=http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2021/H43.png />\n<br>整个过程损失的机械能△E=E<sub> k1</sub>-E<sub> k2</sub>=11.25J。\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 1944140, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2020年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 12, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 12, "source": "2020", "starCount": 0, "title": "(12分)两块等高的长木板A、B紧靠在一起,静止放置在光滑水平面上,一物块C(可视为质点)以v<sub>0</sub>=6m/s的初速度从A板的左端开始运动,如图所示。物块C滑过A板并在B板上滑行一段距离后,与B板以相同速度v=2.5m/s一起运动,若A、B、C三者的质量均为m=1kg。求:\n<br>(1)当物块C滑上B板后,A板具有的动能。\n<br>(2)全过程中损失的机械能。\n<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2021/H24.png' />\n", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 1944140, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 28}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "由题可知,该有机物与氢气的相对密度为22\n<br>即该有机物相对分子质量为:22×2=44,4.4g该有机物即4.4/44=0.1mol\n<br>生成的二氧化碳和水分别为4.48/22.4=0.2mol,3.6/18=0.2mol\n<br>0.1:0.2:0.2=1:2:2\n<br>即化学反应方程式有机物、二氧化碳、水的系数之比为1:2:2\n<br>则可以对方程式进行配平:C<sub>x</sub>H<sub>y</sub>O<sub>z</sub>+nO<sub>2</sub>═2CO<sub>2</sub>+2H<sub>2</sub>O\n<br>C、H原子守恒可得x=2,y=4,即C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>4</sub>O<sub>z</sub>又因为相对分子质量为44,所以z=1,综上该有机物的分子式为C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>4</sub>O\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 1944141, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2020年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 10, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 10, "source": "2020", "starCount": 0, "title": "(10分)某有机物(只含C、H、O三种元素)4.4g完全燃烧生成4.48L(标准状况)二氧化碳和3.6g水,此有机物与氢气的相对密度为22。通过计算求出该有机物的分子式。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 1944141, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 29}], "SimExamStore": {"ExerNum": 29, "CourseId": "H011701", "ExamTime": 120, "ExerSortType": 1, "ScoringMethod": 1, "TotalScore": 150, "SimType": "历年真题", "ExamName": "2